      "body": "### 项目地址\n\nhttps://github.com/aiKeeo/dev-flow\n\n### 类别\n\n人工智能\n\n### 项目标题\n\nDevFlow: Human‑Gated AI Dev Workflow\n\n### 项目描述\n\nProject: DevFlow – human-gated AI dev workflow for Cursor.\nWhat it does: Enforces BDD→DDD→SDD→TDD, requires your approval at each phase.\nPain point solved: Prevents AI from skipping design/tests. Tracks human tasks. 1h to full-stack.\nScenarios: Personal projects, prototypes, team standards, AI education.\nBeginners learn: How to apply BDD/DDD/TDD in real code – design before implementation.\n\n### 亮点\n\n- 🧠 **4-in-1 Methodology** – BDD → DDD → SDD → TDD, no phase skipped.\n- 🚦 **Human‑in‑the‑Loop** – Mandatory gate after each phase using `ask_followup_question`. AI never jumps ahead.\n- ⚡ **1‑Hour Full‑Stack** – From blank project to runnable backend + frontend with tests & docs.\n- 📋 **External Dependency Tracking** – `specs/humanTodo.md` for API keys, approvals, ops tasks. AI pauses until you act.\n- 🧩 **Atomic, Reusable Skills** – 7 independent skills (dev‑flow, product‑requirement, data‑modeling, solution‑design, development, testing, task‑tracking).\n- 🌍 **Cursor Native** – Built for Agent mode, uses standard tool calls.\n- 🔁 **Tested & Documented** – Every phase produces living specs. No hidden magic.\n\n### 示例代码\n\n```markdown\n\n```\n\n### 截图或演示视频\n\n_No response_",
